      "message": "What triggers a replay of xpon configuration in the ONU adapter? Are you saying that when we update the Oper/Connect state of the ONU (using adapter_agent.update_device()) that the XPON config is automatically replayed?\n\nAlso, as I understand, the intention of this change is to ensure that the update of the ONU oper state happens only after message_exchange is fully sent. If that is the case, I would recommend re-adding the update state logic here and then making use of \"yield\" when sending the message_exchange:\n\n                    yield self.message_exchange(self.proxy_address.onu_id,\n                                                self.proxy_address.onu_session_id,\n                                                port_no)\n\nUsing yield will guarantee that the full message exchange is sent before updating the Oper state. And it also keeps the message_exchange logic generic and independent of state changes.",
